{"parse": {"title": "大吉大利魔精齿", "pageid": 28047, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div style=\"user-select:none; pointer-events:none; position:relative; z-index:-1;\"></div><div class=\"antique-content\"><div class=\"antique-img\"><div style=\"margin-top:-13%;\"><img alt=\"大吉大利魔精齿\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1b/Antique-v1a6_antique_icon_4.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"大吉大利魔精齿\" width=\"700\" height=\"728\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"700\" data-file-height=\"728\" /></div><div style=\"position:absolute;width: 40%;height: 34%;right:20%;top: 76%;text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Signature-3039.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d4/Signature-3039.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"370\" height=\"104\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"370\" data-file-height=\"104\" /></div></div><div style=\"max-width:600px; margin: 35px 20px 0 20px; text-shadow: 1px 1px 5px black;\">一串造型奇异的护身符，来自泥鯭的士的除夜赠礼。<br />它们来自各方，形状各异，在她掌心驯顺而乖巧。它们代表的习俗、禁忌与故事，你可以预留更多时间倾听，而这份礼物的意蕴，你现在已然明了。如今，她将它赠给你。<div class=\"test-hide hide-m grey-small\" style=\"float:right; margin-top:40px\">编号ID：161004</div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E6.9D.A5.E6.BA.90\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"来源\">来源</span></h2><div class=\"no-indent\" style=\"text-align:center; max-width:500px\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%9C%E7%9A%84%E8%8A%82%E7%A4%BC\" title=\"除夜的节礼\"><img alt=\"除夜的节礼.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%9C%E7%9A%84%E8%8A%82%E7%A4%BC.jpg/500px-%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%9C%E7%9A%84%E8%8A%82%E7%A4%BC.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%9C%E7%9A%84%E8%8A%82%E7%A4%BC.jpg/750px-%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%9C%E7%9A%84%E8%8A%82%E7%A4%BC.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%9C%E7%9A%84%E8%8A%82%E7%A4%BC.jpg/1000px-%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%9C%E7%9A%84%E8%8A%82%E7%A4%BC.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a><br />\n</p>\n签到活动 - <a href=\"/wiki/%E9%99%A4%E5%A4%9C%E7%9A%84%E8%8A%82%E7%A4%BC\" title=\"除夜的节礼\">除夜的节礼</a></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "收藏品"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">大吉大利魔精齿 <small style=\"color: grey\">Lucky Critter Teeth</small></span></span>"}}